                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "u7jXn",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nStandalone label atom for form controls and grouped controls. Used by Input, Textarea, Select, CheckboxGroup, SwitchGroup, RadioGroup, DatePicker, and FormField.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "X2ahv",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• As the visible label for any form control\n• Inside compound field components like FormField\n• With optional description text for additional context",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "x68wtA",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• For error or validation messages (use FormField)\n• As a standalone heading (use heading typography)\n• With an embedded input or control (Label is text-only)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Tw3Kd",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• supportingText: none | description  →  none\n• required: false | true  →  false\n• state: default | disabled  →  default\n• size: sm | md  →  md",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "k3P2l",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Label text (md) = 14px / semibold (600)\n• Label text (sm) = 12px / semibold (600)\n• Description (md) = 12px / regular (400)\n• Description (sm) = 11px / regular (400)\n• Default fill = $colors-text-header\n• Disabled fill = $colors-text-disabled\n• Required indicator = $colors-text-error",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "L5NqY",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nLabel text must be programmatically associated with its related form control by the consuming component (e.g. via htmlFor/id pairing). The required indicator should also be conveyed via aria-required on the control, not just visually.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                }
              ]
            }
