            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "C7S9me",
              "name": "Button Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JyXaY",
                  "name": "docTitle",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-header",
                  "content": "Button",
                  "lineHeight": 1.3333,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "r4HrMZ",
                  "name": "docSubtitle",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-meta",
                  "content": "Interactive Action Atom",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UG2Je",
                  "name": "docPurpose",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nTriggers an action or event. Buttons communicate what happens when the user interacts — submitting a form, confirming a dialog, navigating forward, or launching a flow.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "d8BHDj",
                  "name": "docWhenUse",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Primary actions: Save, Submit, Confirm, Create\n• Secondary actions alongside a primary action\n• Navigation that feels like a commitment (Continue, Next)\n• Destructive confirmations (Delete, Remove)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pj3wE",
                  "name": "docWhenNot",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Inline navigation (use a link or text button)\n• Toggling state (use Switch or Toggle)\n• Selecting from options (use Radio, Checkbox, or Select)\n• Icon-only actions without a label (use IconButton)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "R9rQi6",
                  "name": "docVariants",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants / Defaults\n• variant: primary | secondary | outline | text  →  primary\n• size: sm | md | lg  →  md\n• icon: none | left | right  →  none\n• state: default | hover | pressed | loading  →  default\n• disabled: true | false  →  false\n• Loading uses a horizontal gradient fill (no spinner)\n• Text variant supports default, hover, and disabled only",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WqSyo",
                  "name": "docTokens",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Primary bg = $colors-btnPrimaryBg / text = $colors-btnPrimaryText\n• Primary hover = $colors-gray-800 / pressed = $colors-btnPrimaryBgActive\n• Secondary bg = $colors-btnPrimaryInvertedBg / border = $colors-borders-dark\n• Secondary hover = $colors-btnPrimaryInvertedBgHover\n• Outline border = $colors-btnSecondaryBorder / text = $colors-btnSecondaryText\n• Outline hover = $colors-btnSecondaryBgHover\n• Text fill = $colors-blue-600 (no bg or border, underline on hover)\n• Font = $font-family-primary, weight 600\n• sm: 14 px / pad [$spacing-2xs, $spacing-sm] / icon 16×16\n• md: 16 px / pad [$spacing-xs, $spacing-md] / icon 20×20\n• lg: 20 px / pad [$spacing-sm, $spacing-lg] / icon 24×24\n• Corner radius: 9999 (pill)\n• Loading = gradient fill from progress color to base color",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LEJUu",
                  "name": "docA11y",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nButtons must have a visible text label; icon-only patterns belong to the IconButton component. Use semantic <button> in code. Disabled buttons should use aria-disabled rather than removing from tab order. Loading state should announce via aria-live and disable re-submission.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
