            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "uzGDS",
              "name": "Textarea Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vktJN",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-header",
                  "content": "Textarea",
                  "lineHeight": 1.3333,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NRIfB",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-meta",
                  "content": "Multi-line text — floating label (same pattern as Input)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "iTt9O",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nMulti-line text entry for forms. Use for comments, notes, descriptions, and message-like inputs. The field uses the same floating-label pattern as the Input atom: empty state shows a large label; filled/focus states show a compact top label and value text below. Visual spec matches Input for border, radius, padding, and state tokens—scaled to a taller (min 120 px) container.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "CBdVA",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Long-form free text: comments, notes, descriptions, messages\n• Bio / about fields, feedback forms, support tickets\n• Any field where the user is expected to type more than one line",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "I3mHd",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Short single-line values (use Input)\n• Rich text / markdown editing (use a rich-text editor)\n• Read-only display (use plain text or TextContent)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "e3fnN",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• Label: floating (matches Input) — rest/empty: large label (\"Notes\") in $colors-text-meta; filled/focus/error/disabled: small top label (xs semibold) + value text from y=28\n• state: default · hover · focus · error · disabled (default: default)\n• value: empty · filled (default: empty)\n• resize: none\n• errorMessage: false · true (default: false)\n\nEach visual state is a separate reusable symbol, named like the Input set.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ugLOV",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Floating label (empty): typo-primary-base-regular + $colors-text-meta; position aligns with Input empty label\n• Floating label (floated): typo-primary-xs-semibold + $colors-text-body (disabled: $colors-text-disabled)\n• Field value: typo-primary-base-regular + $colors-text-header\n• Border default: $colors-borders-dark (1 px); hover stroke: $colors-gray-400\n• Focus outline: $colors-borders-focus (2 px)\n• Disabled field: $colors-gray-50 fill, $colors-gray-300 stroke, $colors-text-disabled\n• Error field: $colors-red-700 stroke, $colors-red-50 fill\n• Error caption: typo-primary-sm-semibold + $colors-text-error; gap $spacing-3xs\n• Horizontal inset: 16 px ($spacing-sm), same as Input; radii: $spacing-3xs\n• Min height: 120 px",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "c0yOBn",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nTextarea must have an accessible label. If the visual label is not shown, the consuming component must provide an accessible label via aria-label or aria-labelledby. Error text should be associated with the textarea through aria-describedby and the field marked with aria-invalid. Disabled textareas must not receive focus.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
