                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "vjqgi",
                      "name": "When to use",
                      "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When to use\n• Independent yes/no options next to text\n• Terms and conditions with primary and supporting copy\n• When Switch or Radio semantics are not appropriate",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                      "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                      "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "yqOD4",
                      "name": "When not to use",
                      "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "When NOT to use\n• Mutually exclusive options (use RadioGroup)\n• Continuous on/off without adjacent copy (use Switch)\n• Navigation or actions that behave like a button",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                      "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                      "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "db6As",
                      "name": "Variants",
                      "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Variants / defaults (checkbox.tsx)\n• size: default | small — small adjusts label/helper typography and spacing\n• checked: driven by input state — design primitive \"component/Checkbox/checked\" uses a Lucide check icon inside the 20×20 control\n• error, helperText, children optional; without children the label column is not rendered\n• errorMessage appears below the control",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                      "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                      "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "YNW7s",
                      "name": "Token usage",
                      "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Token usage (maps to checkbox.tsx)\n• Control 20×20 (w-5 h-5), radius $spacing-3xs\n• Gap between control and label column: gap-3 → $spacing-xs\n• Border default/error: $colors-borders-dark | $colors-borders-error; surface white / $colors-red-50 on error\n• Checked/focus accent: $colors-borders-focus (border and check)\n• Label default: typo-primary-base-regular + $colors-text-body; small: typo-primary-sm-regular\n• Helper: typo-primary-sm-light or typo-primary-xs-light (small), top spacing mt-1 → $spacing-3xs\n• Field error: typo-primary-sm-semibold + $colors-text-error, mt-3xs\n• Disabled: $colors-text-disabled on text",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                      "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                      "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                      "fontWeight": "normal",
                      "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
