            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "VVpXS",
              "name": "Slider Documentation",
              "width": 640,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$spacing-lg",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "j6BG0u",
                  "name": "Docs Title",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-header",
                  "content": "Slider",
                  "lineHeight": 1.3333,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "700",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-xl-bold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Msv6G",
                  "name": "Docs Subtitle",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-meta",
                  "content": "Range Input Atom",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "600",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-semibold-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "xuSJ5",
                  "name": "Purpose",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Purpose\nGeneric range input for selecting a single value on a continuous scale. Provides a track, filled range, and draggable thumb. Use for volume, brightness, zoom, or any unbounded numeric preference.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sF5GX",
                  "name": "When to use",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When to use\n• Single-value selection on a continuous range\n• Volume, brightness, zoom, opacity controls\n• Numeric preferences with visual feedback\n• Settings where precise value entry is not critical",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cQiOt",
                  "name": "When not",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "When NOT to use\n• Dual-range selection (use a range slider)\n• Financial allocation or risk scoring (use domain-specific controls)\n• Precise numeric input (use Input with number type)\n• Stepped / discrete choices (use radio or segmented control)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "c0iG4",
                  "name": "Variants",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Variants & defaults\n• value: 0 · 25 · 50 · 75 · 100 (default: 50)\n• state: default · hover · focus · disabled (default: default)\n• showValue: false · true (default: false)\n\nThe base component is set to value 50. Other positions use descendant overrides on Fill width and Thumb x.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lZIns",
                  "name": "Tokens",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Token usage\n• Track: $colors-gray-200 fill, 4 px tall, cornerRadius 2 (pill)\n• Filled range: $colors-text-action fill\n• Thumb: 20 × 20 ellipse, $colors-background-surface fill, $colors-text-action stroke (2 px inside)\n• Hover: thumb stroke thickens to 3 px\n• Focus: outer shadow ring — $colors-borders-focus, spread 3\n• Disabled: track $colors-gray-100, fill $colors-gray-300, thumb $colors-gray-50 + $colors-gray-300 stroke\n• Value label: typo-primary-xs-semibold + $colors-text-body\n• Width: 320 px; height: 20 px (40 px with value label)",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "g23oX",
                  "name": "A11y",
                  "fill": "$colors-text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Accessibility\nSlider must expose min, max, and current value via aria-valuemin, aria-valuemax, and aria-valuenow. Support keyboard interaction: arrow keys for step changes, Home / End for min / max. The thumb must be focusable and have role=\"slider\".",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4286,
                  "fontFamily": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-font-size",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": "$typo-primary-sm-regular-letter-spacing"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
